From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:56:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(terminal): move long foreground commands to the
 background

terminal.auto_background_seconds (default 0, off): a foreground command
still running after N seconds is handed to the process registry as a
notify_on_complete background session through the existing
yield-to-background path, instead of running on to its timeout. The
result carries the session_id, the output so far and a note not to
re-run it. Local backend only, and only where a completion can reach
the agent; elsewhere the command keeps the plain foreground wait.
